{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id14043187"}, "name":{"label":"nirvana_banana"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-07T13:28:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.12"}, "id":{"label":"13487524769"}, "title":{"label":"Almost perfect"}, "content":{"label":"Haven’t had any issue with the app except for one thing - trying to skip forward. Pressing the forward skip button more than once seems to trigger the app to automatically take you back to the previous episode, and you have to exit out and click again on the one you actually want to listen to. Even waiting several seconds between presses doesn’t seem to stop it from happening. As my favourite podcast has 4 minutes of ads in front of it, this process can become tedious. \n\nOther than that, no problems.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
