{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id15190347"}, "name":{"label":"jenger72"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-01T17:26:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13344517600"}, "title":{"label":"Love this app, Smartspeed is great!"}, "content":{"label":"I've been using Overcast for a long time now and love the the smartspeed feature, which according to the app stats has so far saved me 320 hours of listening time(!) more time to listen to new podcasts!\nChapter markers and audio quality are great too - overall, thoroughly recommended.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id37284641"}, "name":{"label":"DJ_Damon"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-30T08:50:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13334187050"}, "title":{"label":"One feature removed that would make the app more productive if reinstated"}, "content":{"label":"Overcast is an excellent app that is best in class.\n\nHowever, one feature has been removed and not reinstated since the redesign.\n\nThe ability to go to the podcast episode’s web page has been removed. You have to go to the podcast episode list which has a link to the podcast home page. Go to the home page and then find the episode you want. Very unproductive! The developer was asked after the redesign if this can be reinstated and it’s been over a year and still waiting.\n\nSecond, I thought the ability to go to the podcast episode list from an episode listed in a playlist had been removed recently. I was wrong. It hasn’t been removed it’s just hidden at the bottom of the three dots menu and the menu has to be swiped to see the command.\n\nThere’s no indicator to show the menu is longer than the commands listed onscreen. Not sure why this menu has to be swiped, there’s plenty of vertical space to display the entire menu. Is this a limitation of Liquid Glass or does the menu need to be resized to display all commands?\n\nPlease can the website link be reinstated from the old design?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id28354789"}, "name":{"label":"_*_alex_*_"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-30T00:26:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13332539458"}, "title":{"label":"Just a joy"}, "content":{"label":"Overcast stands out as a little luxury in my day to help me learn, relax and sleep. An app that has obviously been meticulously thought through and relentlessly improved. Worth every penny.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id150567455"}, "name":{"label":"Er??"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-27T15:59:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13322839945"}, "title":{"label":"What Happened?"}, "content":{"label":"Used to be the best app for self-managing what to download and easily choose them in Car Play but now it doesn’t seem you can even browse to what’s downloaded even out of car play. Rubbish for car use for me..", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
