{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id104489537"}, "name":{"label":"thomasgcarter"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-21T23:20:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13298264119"}, "title":{"label":"Such an incredible podcast player"}, "content":{"label":"This really is the best podcast player. I basically use it all day everyday. \n\nSo fast and responsive. So customisable. Much better that Apple’s app and other third party offerings. \n\nSmart Speed has saved me literal weeks of listening time. It’s shortens silences, totally naturally, you can’t tell it’s going it. Very natural. \n\nVoice Boost which makes any podcast sound a a little better. \n\nThe new “Go Back” feature is genius! Gives you 10secs to jump back to where you were before skipping. So good for ‘undoing’ accidental seeking. \n\nKeeps getting better. Excited to see how it progresses.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
